https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar","html_url":"https://github.com/IgorMinar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":681,"closed_issues":22796,"state":"open","created_at":"2018-01-18T16:52:20Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T09:12:24Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":4,"created_at":"2018-03-17T08:59:54Z","updated_at":"2021-04-09T16:07:34Z","closed_at":"2021-03-09T20:56:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## I'm submitting a...\r\n<pre><code>\r\n[X] Bug report\r\n</code></pre>\r\n\r\n## Current behavior\r\nWhen lazy-loaded modules are being preloaded (using `PreloadAllModules` strategy or a custom strategy) and a navigation starts to a module that is currently being preloaded, `RouteConfigLoadEnd` event is emitted twice because `RouterConfigLoader.load` is called twice and it calls `onLoadEndListener` twice ([code here](https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/5.2.8/packages/router/src/router_config_loader.ts#L38)).\r\n\r\n## Expected behavior\r\n`Router` emits `RouteConfigLoadEnd` event only once for a lazy-loaded route.\r\n\r\n## Minimal reproduction of the problem with instructions\r\nUse `PreloadAllModules` strategy and after `RouteConfigLoadStart` even is emitted, but before `RotueConfigLoadEnd` happens, call `router.navigate` or `router.navigateByUrl` to the currently pre-loaded module. If you enable tracing, you will see two `RouteConfigLoadEnd` event is being logged in the console.\r\n\r\n## What is the motivation / use case for changing the behavior?\r\nWhen listening to `Router` events, it is not expected that this event is emitted multiple times for the same route. In our case, we need to create a lookup for route config and without having an extra safe-check in our code-base, items will be added multiple times.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Environment\r\n\r\n<pre><code>\r\nAngular version: 5.2.8\r\nChrome (desktop) version 65\r\n</code></pre>\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"atscott","id":479713,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3OTcxMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/479713?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atscott","html_url":"https://github.com/atscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/22842/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/22842/timeline","performed_v